Error [E0059]: the taint-strip modifier is written `#Scrub(Tag)`, not bare `sanitizer`
  --> tests/ui/retired_bare_sanitizer.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | sanitizer fn clean(raw: #Input String) => String :: raw
    | ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `#Scrub(Tag)` names the exact fact removed by the function
 Fix: write: #Scrub(Tag) fn name() { ... }
